              A real (respectively complex) Radon measure on a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hausdorff+topological+space"} Hausdorff topological space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
